| UC-3.1      | Check Payment Status             | 1. User asks for payment status and provides claim ID.<br>2. System retrieves payment data.<br>3. Display status. | "What is the status of my payment?" | Provide claim ID           | Claim ID, payment records from Payment Mgmt | Payment status shown with next steps if needed. | Escalate if no data or complex payment issue.  |
| UC-3.2      | View Outstanding Balance         | 1. User requests balance.<br>2. System fetches balance data.<br>3. Display to user.                               | "What is my outstanding balance?"   | Provide account/claim info | Account or claim ID, balance data           | Balance displayed and payment options shown.    | Escalate if balance details unavailable.       |
| UC-3.3      | Get Denial Reasons               | 1. User provides claim ID.<br>2. System retrieves denial reason.<br>3. Show reason and guidance.                  | "Why was my claim denied?"          | Provide claim ID           | Claim ID, denial info from Denial Mgmt      | Denial reason explained, appeal steps provided. | Escalate if unclear or no denial reason found. |
